  "title": "Pizza Sliders",
  "description": "These delicious pizza sliders with pepperoni and a flavorsome pizza sauce are loaded with cheese on Hawaiian rolls, and baked until golden and gooey.",
  "authors": [
    "Keaton Larson"
  ],
  "date_published": "2023-01-07T09:00:00-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-02-11T09:52:54-05:00",
  "prep_time": "PT20M",
  "cook_time": "PT20M",
  "total_time": "PT40M",
  "yield": [
    "12",
    "12 sliders"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dinner"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "American"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "American"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [
    "publisher-tested"
  ],
  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "1.5 cups (6 oz.) finely pre-shredded low-moisture part-skim mozzarella cheese",
    "1 cup (about 3 1/2 oz.) finely pre-shredded Italian cheese blend",
    "0.25 cup finely chopped fresh basil",
    "0.25 teaspoon black pepper",
    "2 teaspoons dried Italian seasoning, divided",
    "1.33 cups pizza sauce (from 1 [13-oz.] jar)",
    "2 tablespoons sun-dried tomato pesto",
    "1 (12 count) package Hawaiian sweet rolls",
    "0.75 cup (about 3 oz.) thinly sliced pepperoni",
    "2 tablespoons unsalted butter",
    "1 tablespoon grated Parmesan cheese",
    "0.75 teaspoon garlic powder"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Line a rimmed baking sheet with parchment, and place a cooling rack on baking sheet. Spray rack with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fM4nTImskecsQpvcyXvxE-OF2qc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-5178-4x3-step-01-c8164246c7d4456192a4d650c4473e06.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir mozzarella, Italian cheese blend, basil, pepper, and 1 ½ teaspoons of the Italian seasoning together in a small bowl until combined. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V3guK5upZCIgrjUcx8XlEJ7s5UM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-5179-4x3-step-02-549dac89934c44e1bee4e689cc59c4b9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir pizza sauce and pesto together in another small bowl. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cNaAw_NhIxQI3jVsPOLiCvspDVs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-5180-4x3-step-03-b117751f1a75403885b0d0fe62a88e6d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Without separating the individual rolls, cut the entire slab of rolls in half horizontally using a serrated knife. Place bottom layer of rolls on the prepared baking sheet. Set top layer of rolls aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ioL2IVEFKXI2ntvcduNcNuZcugE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-5181-4x3-step-04-008ba52b76394a0caabca127232a1651.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle bottom layer of rolls evenly with half of the cheese mixture; top evenly with half of pepperoni and half of the sauce. Repeat layers once.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/O_erBIvYizUBYwQ6uyeK9lUHaHw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-5183-4x3-step-05a-4343042884254378a6e34169488a01d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cheese melts, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3PhHQ0zN2lB1_VVM4R6ewSkyt5Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-5191-4x3-step-06-081c75716f9d4ea5825515f3697a0da6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, combine butter, Parmesan, garlic powder, and remaining 1/2 teaspoon Italian seasoning in a small saucepan; cook over medium, stirring occasionally, until butter melts, 1 to 2 minutes. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ERHSVJn59Q1yTOsxXey1-YgodT4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-5187-4x3-step-07-b534c0ad833e4648a6270b158472df73.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove rolls from oven, and add top layer of rolls; brush top of rolls evenly with butter mixture. Return to preheated oven, and bake until rolls are golden brown and crisp, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DTWPrU88cN6hnomd8HesEa3IvMg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-5193-4x3-step-08-dad14a9d531d49a0a5a49b927270a7df.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Separate the rolls, and serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PRF0UayNowLx_NDwbjF89tkU_H4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-5195-4x3-step-09-8884218eabf24fceb05152f6e8ec372e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy! Recipe developed by Laura Kanya",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B5rgNZ52adf7zSo0rV4YFpEdlHE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/8521921-pizza-sliders-DDMFS-4x3-7f5677cd78da4f9788eb7a3e14cc4ecf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/8521921/step_10.webp"
    }
