    "description": "In this video, we show a fun and delicious twist on traditional sliders - Pizza Sliders! A combination of a burger and a pizza, these sliders are the perfect party food. They’re also a great option for a fun and casual weeknight meal. Hamburger buns are filled with a mixture of pizza sauce, mozzarella cheese, pepperoni, and your favorite pizza toppings. The sliders are then baked in an oven until the cheese is melted and the buns are crispy. The end result is a delicious and portable mini pizza that is perfect for dipping in marinara sauce or ranch dressing. Whether you're hosting a party or just looking for a fun and easy dinner option, these Pizza Sliders are sure to be a hit.",
